comment.narrative:
21-02-2023: The 6 new developed courses namely:
-Poultry Production NQF Level 2;
-Agribusiness NQF Level 2;
-Livestock, meatproduction and entrepreneurship NQF Level 2;
-Mechanization and Irrigation NQF Level 2;
-Treecrop Cocoa Production NQF Level 2;
-Arable crops NQF Level 2.

1 Climate Smart Agriculture Course
1 short course on Cocoa Agripreneurship was also developed in collaboration with OKP TMT with the involvement of the FI staff.
